{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "3f0d9b1a-6e2a-4a2b-9b1a-6e2a4a2b9b1a",
    "name": "Multi-Vendor E-Commerce API",
    "description": "Real, implemented endpoints only (Phases 1-25). No Wallet/Commission, Promotion/Coupon, Review, Notification, or Audit endpoints exist yet -- their Prisma models exist but have no application layer. No real payment gateway is integrated (foundation only, no signature verification). ADMIN-only requests (Category create/update, Vendor verification/activation, Refund create) require adminAccessToken to be set manually, since no self-service admin-provisioning endpoint exists -- assign the ADMIN role to a seeded user directly via Prisma. RBAC demo permission-based requests similarly require manually-seeded Permission/RolePermission rows. IMPORTANT: Cart 'Add item to cart' requires the variant's parent Product, Vendor, AND the variant itself to all be ACTIVE -- a freshly-applied Vendor is PENDING by default, so run 04 Vendors > Update vendor verification status (twice: UNDER_REVIEW then VERIFIED) and Activate vendor BEFORE 11 Cart, or 'Add item to cart' returns 400. Suggested execution order: Auth -> Vendors (apply, then ADMIN verifies + activates) -> Shops -> Categories (ADMIN) -> Products (create, then update status to ACTIVE) -> Product Variants -> Inventory (restock) -> Product Images -> Cart -> Checkout -> Orders / Vendor Orders -> Payments -> Webhooks -> Refunds.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{accessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "{{baseUrl}}"
    }
  ],
